          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "بی درنگ (bi derang) — \"without delay, at once\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "او بی درنگ به آمبولانس زنگ زد. U bi derang be âmbulâns zang zad. She called an ambulance without delay."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Formal and literary; in speech fowran or zud is more usual. Built from bi \"without\" and derang \"delay\"."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "bi derang is built from bi \"without\" and derang \"a delay, a pause\", which is inherited from Middle Persian dērang, \"a period, a duration\" (EtymDB)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
